  "notes": [
    "**Quejar** is a regular **-AR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: **quejado** (regular)",
    "**Almost always used reflexively: quejarse (de)** = to complain (about)",
    "Reflexive forms: *me quejo, te quejas, se queja, nos quejamos, se quejan*",
    "Common usage:",
    "*Me quejo del servicio* (I complain about the service)",
    "*Siempre se queja* (He/She always complains)",
    "*No te quejes* (Don't complain)",
    "Related noun: **la queja** (complaint)",
    "Can also mean \"to moan/groan\" (pain): *Se quejaba del dolor* (He/She was moaning from pain)"
  ],
